/-!
# The original max2 generators on a certified invariant subquotient

The 62 rows embed a coordinate space into the original 112-dimensional row
module. A checked right inverse proves their independence. Projection onto
the last 12 coordinates has a checked section. The two intertwining
identities certify invariance of the 62-dimensional space; the projection
identities certify invariance of its first 50 coordinates and the exact
published quotient matrices. All arithmetic is checked by the Lean kernel.

The row witnesses are from `LowerBound/source/canonical_quotient.json`.
`QuotientBridge/source/generate.py` supplies the retraction and regenerates
this file. Source: the unchanged ATLAS `TwoCoreCentralizer/source/J4G1-max2W1`
and its attribution, and GLS3 Table 5.3i, printed p.270.
-/

